====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|of a dog, etc.}} To [[hunt]] or [[kill]] rats. {{defdate|from 19th c.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[betray]] a political party, cause or principle; to betray someone, to [[desert]] a person or thing. {{defdate|from 19th c.}}
