|passage=In 1962, the higher a girl's hair was '''ratted''' the more available she was, it was simply understood.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive|with [[on]] or [[out]]}} To [[inform]] on someone; to betray someone to the police or authorities. {{defdate|from 20th c.}}
